      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "With the reporters giving an outline of the disaster, the whole nation was shocked by the damage and the victim’s extreme suffering. People were moved when they read that the survivors comforted each other by saying “Congratulations! You survived!”.",
        "zh": "记者概述了这场灾难，灾害的破坏和受害者的巨大痛苦震惊了全国。人们被感动了，因为他们读到幸存者互相安慰，说道：“恭喜你！你活下来了！”",
